---
description: Keep local secrets out of git and out of Cursor dashboards
globs: apps/web/**,scripts/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Local secrets

- Do not create, mount, or commit `.dev.vars`. `pnpm run dev` injects env via `op run` when `OP_ENVIRONMENT_ID` is set; otherwise it uses the current shell environment.
- Do not commit live Cloudflare account, D1, KV, or domain IDs. Public `wrangler.jsonc` stays placeholder-only.
- Cursor Cloud Agents: only `OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN` and `OP_ENVIRONMENT_ID` in Cursor secrets.
- `AGENT_LOGIN_PASSWORD` is last-resort form fill only. Prefer `pnpm run agent:signin-url`. Never log the password, never add it to Worker `Env` or production secrets. `pnpm run dev` strips it from the Vite child env.
- `AGENT_LOGIN_EMAIL` may be on the local Worker (dev wrangler secrets list) so first login can claim the seed household.
